<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Ar\u0131kan staj sigortas\u0131 talebini TBMM\u2019de g\u00fcndemde tutacak","articleSection":"G\u00dcNDEM","dateCreated":"2026-10-05T02:06:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-05T02:06:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-05T02:06:00+03:00","wordCount":166,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.e-gundem.net\/arikan-staj-sigortasi-talebini-tbmmde-gundemde-tutacak"},"articleBody":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, 4 Ekim Pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc Ankara\u2019da Stajyer ve \u00c7\u0131rakl\u0131k Sigortas\u0131 Ma\u011fdurlar\u0131 Federasyonu Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Murat Ayd\u0131n ve heyetiyle bir araya geldi. G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme, partinin resmi hesab\u0131ndan duyuruldu.\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan, staj ve \u00e7\u0131rakl\u0131k d\u00f6nemindeki \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma s\u00fcrelerinin emeklilik hesab\u0131nda dikkate al\u0131nmas\u0131 y\u00f6n\u00fcndeki talepleri dinledi\u011fini a\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131. Konuyu ba\u015fta TBMM olmak \u00fczere farkl\u0131 platformlarda g\u00fcndemde tutaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtti.\r\n\r\nA\u00e7\u0131klama, siyasi destek ve konuyu g\u00fcndeme ta\u015f\u0131ma taahh\u00fcd\u00fc i\u00e7eriyor. G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme duyurusunda y\u00fcr\u00fcrl\u00fc\u011fe girmi\u015f yeni bir emeklilik d\u00fczenlemesi a\u00e7\u0131klanmad\u0131.\r\n\r\nFoto\u011fraf: Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, Ali Babacan, Ahmet Davuto\u011flu ve Celal M\u00fcmtaz Ak\u0131nc\u0131; 15 Ocak 2025 tarihli ar\u015fiv foto\u011fraf\u0131. 4 Ekim\u2019deki federasyon g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmesini g\u00f6stermemektedir. Aaras29 \/ Wikimedia Commons, CC0 1.0. G\u00f6rsel boyutland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.\r\n\r\nKaynaklar: Saadet Partisi resmi g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme duyurusu \u00b7 ANKA \/ Haberler.com, 4 Ekim 22.58 \u00b7 Foto\u011fraf kayna\u011f\u0131 \u00b7 CC0 1.0","description":"Saadet Partisi lideri, 4 Ekim\u2019de Ankara\u2019da Murat Ayd\u0131n ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndaki federasyon heyetiyle g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015ft\u00fc. Staj ve \u00e7\u0131rakl\u0131k s\u00fcrelerinin emeklilik hesab\u0131na\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/egundemnet.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/e-gundem-net\/uploads\/2026\/10\/arikan-yeniyol-20250115.png","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Ar\u0131kan staj sigortas\u0131 talebini TBMM\u2019de g\u00fcndemde tutacak"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.e-gundem.net\/#organization","name":"E-G\u00fcndem","image":"https:\/\/egundemnet.teimg.com\/e-gundem-net\/uploads\/2024\/10\/werty.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/egundemnet.teimg.com\/e-gundem-net\/uploads\/2024\/10\/werty.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Eren DEDEKO\u00c7","url":"https:\/\/www.e-gundem.net\/muhabir\/5\/eren-dedekoc"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Eren DEDEKO\u00c7","url":"https:\/\/www.e-gundem.net\/muhabir\/5\/eren-dedekoc"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.e-gundem.net\/#organization","name":"E-G\u00fcndem","url":"https:\/\/www.e-gundem.net"}}</script>


